Short:        a tron lightcycles game for 2-4 players
Author:       gus0650@yahoo.com (Gustaf Stechmann)
Uploader:     gus0650 yahoo com (Gustaf Stechmann)
Type:         game/2play
Version:      1.0
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Distribution: Aminet

Welcome to cyberTRON!

I wrote this game in 1992 using BlitzBasic 2, with the idea 
to promote the sales of my home-made 4 player adapter.

(The adapter is currently out of stock ;-)

This game is freeware.

The game was developed on a PAL Amiga but should detect NTSC 
and resize the playfield accordingly. This is however 
not fully tested.

Hope you enjoy it!
--Gus
